@startuml
' An architecture drawn by hand: boxes with a list, colors by layer.
skinparam handwritten true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 18
title <size:22>AI agent platform</size>
caption Vendor technologies are illustrative design choices.

actor "User\n(chat, Slack, API)" as user
rectangle "🚪 <size:16>Agent gateway</size>" as gateway #E6E0F8

rectangle "🔒 <size:16>Identity & auth</size>\n* SSO and OAuth\n* User to agent scopes" as auth #DDEEDD
rectangle "📋 <size:16>Agent registry</size>\n* Agent definitions\n* System prompts\n* Versioning" as registry #DDEEDD
rectangle "🧠 <size:16>Memory service</size>\n* Session memory\n* Long-term memory\n* User preferences" as memory #DCE8F8

rectangle "🤖 <size:16>Agent orchestrator</size>\n* Plan, act, observe loop\n* Sub-agent delegation\n* Retry and error recovery\n* Context window management" as orch #FBE0E0
rectangle "🛡 <size:16>Permission engine</size>\n* Policy check per action\n* Least-privilege scopes\n* Read and write tiers" as perm #FCF0D0
rectangle "🙋 <size:16>Approval queue</size>\n* High-risk actions paused\n* A human approves or rejects\n* Timeout and escalate" as approval #FCF0D0

rectangle "🔀 <size:16>LLM router</size>\n* Reasoning model\n* Fast model\n* Fallbacks" as llm #DDEEDD
rectangle "🔧 <size:16>Tool registry</size>\n* Tool schemas\n* Discovery and search\n* Rate limits per tool" as tools #DDEEDD
rectangle "🔌 <size:16>MCP gateway</size>\n* Auth to MCP servers\n* Tool call proxy\n* Response sanitizing" as mcp #DDEEDD
rectangle "MCP server:\nGitHub" as gh #DDEEDD
rectangle "MCP server:\nJira" as jira #DDEEDD
rectangle "MCP server:\ndatabase" as db #DDEEDD
rectangle "💻 <size:16>Code sandbox</size>\n* Isolated containers\n* Time and resource limits" as sandbox #DDEEDD

rectangle "📈 <size:16>Tracing</size>\n* Every step and tool call\n* Token cost\n* Replay runs" as tracing #DDEEDD
rectangle "📄 <size:16>Audit log</size>" as audit #DCE8F8
rectangle "⭐ <size:16>What it can do</size>\n* Multi-step planning\n* Tools and MCP\n* Short and long-term memory\n* A human in the loop\n* Full trace and replay" as can #F3EEFC;line.dashed;line:9B72E0

user -> gateway
gateway --> orch
auth -> orch
registry -> orch
orch <-> llm : reason,\ndecide
orch --> perm
perm --> approval : needs approval
approval --> user : approve?
perm -> tools
memory -> perm
tools --> mcp
tools --> sandbox
mcp --> gh
mcp --> jira
mcp --> db
orch ..> tracing
db ..> audit
can ..> llm
@enduml
